# Throwaway diagnostic probes (#193). They must live INSIDE this package to resolve @playwright/test
# from apps/fed/node_modules — a copy in a temp dir dies with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND — so without a
# gitignored home they get written into a tracked directory and have to be deleted before they leak
# into a commit. Anything worth keeping becomes a real spec under e2e/ instead.
